Note that this implementation assumes that the incoming PDU stream is an array of `NFAPI_RX_PDU_T` structures, which can be accessed using the `rx_pdus` parameter. The function also includes mechanisms for handling system dependencies and external data sources for QoS parameters and L3 header values, as well as thread safety and data integrity considerations when executing in a multi-threaded environment.']

